{
  "_readme": "Unit structure contract for the parts pipeline and the M1/M2 gates. ADR-010: every threshold and every required part name lives here. tools/validators/unit-structure.mjs reads this file. A GLB is STRUCTURED only when the class parts are separate nodes, pivots sit on the real axis, moving parts are not welded to the hull, meshes are closed, the drawn size matches data/rules/unit-dimensions.json, local travel is -Z after manifest yawOffset, the mesh sits on y=0, triangles and textures are inside the unit-validator caps, and a material is named houseTint. Verdicts are STRUCTURED, PARTIAL, STATIC, BROKEN.",
